SUMMARY:🎶 An Evening of Sound & Stillness 🎶
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🎶 An Evening of So
 und & Stillness 🎶**\n\nStep away from the noise of the world and into a
 n evening of presence\, reflection\, and timeless music.\n\nJoin us for a 
 communal album listening experience as we immerse ourselves in The Moody B
 lues' groundbreaking 1967 masterpiece\, Days of Future Passed—heard exac
 tly as it was intended: from beginning to end\, uninterrupted.\n\n**✨ Wh
 at to Expect:**\n🎧 A high-quality\, start-to-finish listening experienc
 e\n🪑 A peaceful\, welcoming space to simply be present\n💙 No agenda.
  No discussion. No distractions.\n🌙 Just a room full of open hearts sha
 ring the journey through music together.\n\nWhether you're rediscovering t
 his iconic album or hearing it for the very first time\, you'll be invited
  to slow down\, breathe deeply\, and allow the music to speak for itself.\
 n\n📅 Friday\, August 14\n🕖 Doors Open: 6:45 PM\n🎵 Music Begins: 7
 :00 PM (promptly)\n📍 Blue Ridge Auditorium\nCommunity Commons at Center
  for Spiritual Living Asheville\n\n💝 Love Offering Welcome to support t
 he Community\n\nBring a friend\, find a comfortable seat\, and let the mus
 ic carry you through an unforgettable evening of sound and stillness.\n\n#
 CommunityCommonsAsheville #CSLAsheville #MusicListeningParty #AlbumListeni
 ng #DaysOfFuturePassed #TheMoodyBlues #CommunityConnection #MindfulListeni
 ng #LiveInspired #MusicLovers #AshevilleEvents #FridayNight #SoundAndStill
 ness
