SUMMARY:🌎 Wed Nite Special: Building a New Earth With Forrest Rivers
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌎 Wed Nite Special
 : Building a New Earth**\n*With Forrest Rivers*\n\n📅 Wednesday\, August
  19\n🕡 6:30 PM\n💝 Love Offering\n\nIn a world that often feels fille
 d with uncertainty—from conflict and economic challenges to healthcare c
 oncerns and environmental change—it can be easy to wonder how one person
  can make a difference.\n\n**✨ The answer begins within.**\nJoin inspira
 tional speaker\, author\, and spiritual coach Forrest Rivers for an uplift
 ing and interactive evening exploring how each of us can help create a mor
 e peaceful\, compassionate\, and harmonious New Earth.\n\n*Together we'll 
 discover practical and spiritual ways to:*\n🌱 Cultivate inner peace in 
 challenging times\n💖 Live from a place of love and compassion\n🤝 Be 
 of greater service to our communities and the world\n🌟 Deepen our conne
 ction with Spirit/Source\n🌍 Become a conscious co-creator of a more har
 monious future\n\n**This experiential workshop includes:**\n🧘 Guided me
 ditations\n💬 Meaningful group discussion\n🎶 Heart-opening chanting a
 nd singing\n✨ Inspiring spiritual insights you can apply in everyday lif
 e\n\nWhether you're seeking hope\, connection\, or a renewed sense of purp
 ose\, this evening offers a welcoming space to explore what's possible whe
 n we come together with open hearts.\n\n**🌿 About Forrest Rivers**\nFor
 rest Rivers is an inspirational speaker\, author\, and spiritual coach who
 se awakening journey began on the island of Maui\, where the healing power
  of nature called him into a deeper spiritual path.\nA former college prof
 essor\, Forrest now leads workshops that inspire people to cultivate inner
  peace\, create positive change\, and strengthen their connection with the
 ir higher power. He has appeared on more than 60 conscious living\, spirit
 uality\, wellness\, and radio programs\, sharing practical wisdom for livi
 ng with greater intention and joy.\n\n**📚 He is the author of:**\n• T
 he Hippie Revival and Collected Writings\n• Humanity's Spiritual Rebirth
 : Wisdom to Transform Struggles into Strength\n• Everyday Communion: A G
 uide to a Sacred Life\n\n*Come be part of an evening of inspiration\, refl
 ection\, music\, and community as we explore how each of us can help build
  a New Earth—one loving choice at a time.*\n\n#BuildingANewEarth #Forres
 tRivers #CSLAsheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville #InspiredLiving #Spiritua
 lCommunity #ConsciousLiving #InnerPeace #Meditation #LoveInAction #NewEart
 h #PersonalTransformation #Community #AshevilleEvents
